                                "target_word": "supremacy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d4f773d-2d90-315e-8e5c-91297aa50c85",
                                        "entry_id": "cf477ca7-bf6b-3115-8c9e-02fb42ad8a2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being supreme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8353d9c7-4e76-3fd6-b7ae-8d5575cb37b7",
                                        "entry_id": "cf477ca7-bf6b-3115-8c9e-02fb42ad8a2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Power over all others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e67b2ad1-d531-377c-836e-cff4e5a467f3",
                                        "entry_id": "cf477ca7-bf6b-3115-8c9e-02fb42ad8a2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The ideology that a specified group is superior to others or should have supreme power over them."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in-compounds",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "010ffa87-ac3e-46f9-8f37-bcbdf8ee55b3",
                                                "sense_id": "e67b2ad1-d531-377c-836e-cff4e5a467f3",
                                                "text": "white supremacy"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37aff184-a9c5-4478-bbc0-cd32f9288119",
                                                "sense_id": "e67b2ad1-d531-377c-836e-cff4e5a467f3",
                                                "text": "Fighting a war against Hitler's Nazi ideology, with its doctrine of Aryan supremacy and its \"final solution\" to protect against an \"inferior people,\" accentuated the final irony of an America fighting a racist ideology while trying to keep its own racist ideology intact."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a78a973-45f5-3fab-a77b-ba5aea084892",
                                        "entry_id": "cf477ca7-bf6b-3115-8c9e-02fb42ad8a2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A state of privilege for a specified group relative to other people in society."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in-compounds",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dffbd641-a4ff-4f0c-86ab-47de94b5e646",
                        "source_entry_id": "4cb7a362-7e8b-35fc-9a5d-206f4ec4537d",
                        "source_sense_id": "2a543eaf-aa46-3431-8884-a8aaf1a6c8d5",
                        "target_lang_word": "suprématie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "suprématie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54c53068-1e32-3c49-81ad-fcdf9d64790a",
                                        "entry_id": "5f6333c0-d86b-3a58-aef8-caffaffd91ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Supériorité, prééminence, excellence au-dessus de tous les autres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "506e018a-5d5b-4729-afd3-13065c787c39",
                                                "sense_id": "54c53068-1e32-3c49-81ad-fcdf9d64790a",
                                                "text": "Le sujet de la profonde inimitié qui régnait entre les Reybert et les Moreau provenait d’une blessure faite par Mme de Reybert à Mme Moreau, par suite d’une première pointillerie que s’était permise la femme du régisseur à l’arrivée des Reybert, afin de ne pas laisser entamer sa suprématie par une femme née de Corroy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16e9e861-2fde-4ad1-86f4-6eda82c17c72",
                                                "sense_id": "54c53068-1e32-3c49-81ad-fcdf9d64790a",
                                                "text": "La période de l’entre-deux-guerres fut pourtant dominée, en pays musulmans, par la suprématie politique d’élites dirigeantes laïques visant à promouvoir une idéologie politique séculière, le nationalisme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05ac40ed-c496-4281-b1e9-7c48f386bdb5",
                                                "sense_id": "54c53068-1e32-3c49-81ad-fcdf9d64790a",
                                                "text": "L’unilatéralisme américain et la mondialisation libérale procèdent d’une même logique. Ils refusent la suprématie du droit et de la délibération collective."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
